{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"options":{"content":"","images":{},"widgets":{}},"periodicTable":false,"type":"multiple"},"hints":[{"content":"We can play around with the expressions in the answer choices to see if they are the same as $2(-6c+3)+4c$.","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the first expression is equivalent to $2(-6c+3)+4c$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{-8c+6}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} 2(-6c+3)+4c  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-8c+6}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} (2)(-6c)+(2)3+4c   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-8c+6}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -12c+6+4c   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-8c+6}   \u0026= -8c+6 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the second expression is equivalent to $2(-6c+3)+4c$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{3(-4c+2)+4c}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} 2(-6c+3)+4c  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{3(-4c+2)+4c}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} (2)(-6c)+(2)3+4c   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{3(-4c+2)+4c}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -12c+6+4c \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{3(-4c+2)+4c}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -8c+6 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{(3)(-4c)+(3)2+4c}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}  -8c+6 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-12c+6+4c}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}  -8c+6 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-8c+6}   \u0026= -8c+6\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $2(-6c+3)+4c$ :\n\n\n-  ${-8c+6} $\n\n-  ${3(-4c+2)+4c} $","images":{},"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Which expressions are equivalent to $2(-6c+3)+4c$ ?**  \n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$-8c+6$","correct":true},{"content":"$3(-4c+2)+4c$","correct":true},{"isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"onePerLine":true,"randomize":false},"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
